          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नियमावली — niyamāvalī — \"a rulebook\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शाळेने सगळ्या पालकांना नियमावली दिली. śāḷene sagḷyā pālkānnā niyamāvalī dilī. The school gave all the parents a rulebook."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नियमावली (niyamāvalī) is a tatsama compound of Sanskrit niyama, \"rule\", and āvali, \"a row\" (Monier-Williams): a row of rules."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
